Case Study 39: Multi-Stage Examination Eligibility System
1. Problem Statement
Check examination eligibility based on attendance, internal marks, laboratory completion and fee payment.
2. Objectives
•	Read eligibility details.
•	Check multiple conditions.
•	Display every unmet requirement.
3. Algorithm
19.	Read attendance, internal marks, lab status and fee status.
20.	Check each condition.
21.	Print every unmet requirement.
22.	If none are unmet, display eligible.
4. Python Source Code
attendance = int(input("Enter attendance percentage: "))
internal = int(input("Enter internal marks out of 30: "))
lab = input("Lab completed? (yes/no): ")
fees = input("Fees paid? (yes/no): ")

eligible = True

if attendance < 75:
    print("Attendance requirement not met")
    eligible = False
if internal < 15:
    print("Internal marks requirement not met")
    eligible = False
if lab != "yes":
    print("Laboratory not completed")
    eligible = False
if fees != "yes":
    print("Fees not paid")
    eligible = False

if eligible:
    print("Eligible for examination")
5. Sample Output
Enter attendance percentage: 80
Enter internal marks out of 30: 20
Lab completed? (yes/no): yes
Fees paid? (yes/no): no
Fees not paid
6. Test Cases
80% attendance, 20 marks, lab yes, fees yes → Eligible. Attendance 60% → attendance requirement not met.
